@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Is the app running?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Can it reach the database?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### System info (should show testMode true, ordersEnabled false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/ping

### Unknown route -> JSON 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nothing-here

### Deliberate error -> safe JSON 500
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/throw

### Validation error -> JSON 400 (Name too short, Quantity out of range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "quantity": 99 }

### Valid -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test", "quantity": 2 }
